{"id":"expl:packages/ui/src/viz.ts@L107","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/ui/src/viz.ts","span":{"start":107,"end":108}},"file":"packages/ui/src/viz.ts","span":{"start":107,"end":108},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:9fe19ca17de4a70c3b64b954cfadade0a57fb20690f173ab260bb4489526fb4c","meta":{"text":"A functional module for the overview pane — the module-segmented view from `buildFunctionalMap`,\ncolored by palette index so the UI can render module cards + per-module cluster filtering."}}
